fix: team detail camelCase serialization and UI cleanup

Backend:
- Add #[serde(rename_all = "camelCase")] to TeamSummary and TeamDetail
  structs so created_at/updated_at/agent_count serialize correctly for
  the frontend (was causing "undefined" for timestamps and counts)
- Remove status field from TeamSummary (not meaningful, always "active")

Frontend:
- Remove Config tab (teams have no editable config in this framework)
- Remove Sessions column from Agents tab
- Remove unused Settings import
